ws":false,"display_dots":true,"author_1":"Anastasia V.[checkmark]","image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-01-18_at_12.41.51_AM.png","text_1":"<p>Habe sie mit meinem Freund für eine Convention bestellt – tolle Qualität und Preis, wir sind sehr zufrieden!❤️<\/p>","author_2":"","text_2":"","author_3":"<em>Author<\/em> [stars","text_3":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"icon_with_text_xmVNCp":{"type":"icon_with_text","settings":{"layout":"horizontal","icon_color":"accent-1","desktop_icon_size":48,"desktop_spacing":12,"desktop_text_size":18,"mobile_icon_size":36,"mobile_spacing":10,"mobile_text_size":12,"icon_1":"favorite","icon_1_fill":false,"image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/shipped_1.png","heading_1":"Kostenloser Versand","icon_2":"undo","icon_2_fill":false,"image_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/clean.png","heading_2":"Premium-Qualität","icon_3":"","icon_3_fill":false,"image_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/quality.png","heading_3":"14 Tage risikofrei","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"collapsible_tab_A4fJ9U":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Beschreibung","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":false,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>The Dragon Couple’s Set<\/strong><\/p><p>A set that combines playful design with ultimate comfort. Thoughtfully crafted, it merges modern style with a touch of dragon magic. Perfect as a statement for couples who love to celebrate their bond through matching outfits. The Dragon Set adds a unique and fun flair to any look.<\/p><p><br\/>• Comfortable and breathable fabric<\/p><p>• Matching dragon-themed design for couples<\/p><p>• Relaxed fit for everyday comfort<\/p><p>Available in multiple colors and sizes to perfectly highlight your connection. The ideal choice for couples who love to stand out together.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Wie wählt man die richtige Größe?","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p>Unsere Größen sind an Drachen-Designs angepasst, aber wie bei jedem Meisterwerk gibt es eine kleine Toleranz (innerhalb von 3 cm). Werft einen Blick in unsere detaillierte Größentabelle, um die perfekte Passform zu finden. Solltet ihr euch dennoch unsicher sein, kontaktiert uns – wir helfen euch gerne weiter!<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_FUzynJ":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Woraus besteht die Jacke und wie pflegt man sie?","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p>Das Drachen-Set besteht aus strapazierfähigem Polyester, das sowohl leicht als auch robust ist. Es kann im Schonwaschgang in der Maschine gewaschen werden – schließlich sollte es nicht schwer sein, eure Drachenenergie zu entfesseln.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_EdHWbL":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Wie lange dauert die Lieferung?","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>Hinweis:<\/strong> Die schwarze Farbe ist fast ausverkauft, daher kann es zu Lieferverzögerungen kommen. Vielen Dank für Ihr Verständnis.<\/p><p><strong>Bearbeitungszeit:<\/strong> Im Durchschnitt dauert es 1–2 Werktage, um Ihre Bestellung vor dem Versand vorzubereiten.<\/p><p><strong>Lieferzeit:<\/strong> Nach dem Versand wird die Bestellung je nach Standort innerhalb von 4–7 Werktagen zugestellt. Bitte beachten Sie, dass Feiertage die Lieferzeiten beeinflussen können.<\/p><p><strong>Stornierungsrichtlinie:<\/strong> Bitte beachten Sie, dass eine Bestellung nicht mehr storniert werden kann, sobald sie versandt wurde. Wenn Sie Änderungen an Ihrer Bestellung vornehmen oder diese stornieren möchten, stellen Sie bitte sicher, dass die Anfrage vor der Bearbeitung und dem Versand der Bestellung erfolgt.<\/p><p><strong>Versandkosten:<\/strong> Wir bieten kostenlosen Versand an.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}}},"block_order":["rating_stars_fE9P9j","title","price","text_g6JVyW","description_dL4TBc","divider_Kxj7PX","text_QYQUqY","text_cyqaex","text_LnmVwW","text_eUTkNL","custom_liquid_mN8rj9","sizing_chart_CEnf8p","e7a28cbe-03cb-4c9d-a2c4-0e3e76ffb3e5","quantity_selector_ckhGbe","kaching_bundles_app_block_wRxFW8","custom_liquid_iWgmqH","buy_buttons","payment_badges_CXb7Y8","shipping_checkpoints_rBKd9j","custom_liquid_heQhhg","custom_liquid_Pk4qij","text_baxBBC","reviews_8UgFbe","icon_with_text_xmVNCp","collapsible_tab_A4fJ9U","de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1","collapsible_tab_FUzynJ","collapsible_tab_EdHWbL"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"display_id":false,"enable_sticky_info":true,"display_variant_image_first":false,"disable_prepend":false,"hide_variants":false,"variant_image_filtering":"none","image_zoom":"none","arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","video_player":"play_btn","enable_video_looping":false,"autoplay_videos_pause_btn":false,"video_sound_btn":false,"video_timeline":false,"play_btn_color_scheme":"accent-1","sound_btn_color_scheme":"inverse","timeline_color":"accent-1","media_size":"small","media_position":"left","gallery_layout":"thumbnail_slider","desktop_thumbnails_count":5,"constrain_to_viewport":true,"media_fit":"cover","desktop_arrows_position":"hidden","mobile_media_corner_radius":0,"mobile_spacing_pixels":0,"mobile_arrows_position":"sides","mobile_pagination":"hidden","mobile_thumbnails":"show","mobile_thumbnails_count":8,"mobile_scroll_padding_percentage":0,"mobile_scroll_padding_pixels":0,"enable_mobile_outher_spacing":false,"mobile_slides_container_width":100,"mobile_slides_inner_width":100,"trust_badge_position":"top-right","trust_badge_size":"mediu